# FINER WHERE THE SURFACE ASKS (mesh2splat_cells; tests/CMakeLists.txt,
# mesh2splat_refine_*): the same curved strip as chrome, as a rough metal and
# as a coated paint, a flat chrome card, and two textured cards, one whose map
# is a fine checker and one whose map is plain grey, and the curved strip again
# as a clear and as a frosted glass. Only the chrome strip, the clear glass
# strip and the checker walk a finer cell. Written by hand from a script; the camera
# looks straight down, for the levels of detail from a camera.
